    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Several months ago, a sinister shadow claimed the lives of two military submarines, vanishing them into the unfathomable depths of the ocean. Suspicions run deep, pointing to an aquatic entity of unparalleled terror.<br><br>Your mission: descend to the perilous abyss in a compact submarine and extract knowledge about this nameless creature without becoming its next victim.<br><br>Will you come back alive, or will the abyss swallow you whole?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Your submarine has three outside cameras and a compass, use them for navigation.<br></li><li> Navigate the abyss on your terms in your submarine to explore and investigate.<br></li><li> Multiples signals and unusual activities were founded by the battleship radar, the coordinates are yours to use.<br></li><li> Use the hatch to swim to place the submarine can't reach and find clues.</li></ul><br>One important rule, DON'T WANDER TOO FAR AWAY FROM THE SUBMARINE!<br><br><br>Warning : This game contains flickering lights and visual FX, which may cause discomfort or seizures in sensitive individuals. Player discretion is advised.",
